      "rationale": "Trusted fold-summary fact replacing the supplied #sumAcc execution over an arbitrary all-integer list with sumIntVS; Stage 1 installs it before proof and contains no prior proof of this exact rule.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-8c6fd5f43e6635bfa3e7668c921b0d8e3f46d6d1de6484989e3107ed21ffcc0c",
